<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-AUCKLAND BEAT FREE STATE IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUCKLAND BEAT FREE STATE IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN, South Africa 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auckland beat Free State 24-15 (halftime 10-6) in a Super 12 Series rugby union match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Free State - Penalties: Jannie de Beer 5</p>
<p>Auckland - Tries: Joeli Vidiri, Ofisa Tonu'u. Conversion: Adrian Cashmore. Penalties: Cashmore 4</p>
</text>
